{"unit_id":"Domaki-co__dsh-message-forward#card-zh","repo":"Domaki-co/dsh-message-forward","commit":"27ac583ad4a62be7ad743e02ea99cde6a7f74391","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-forward 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的跨会话消息转发插件，可从会话中提取用户消息或模型回复，并发送到其他会话或新会话。它在回复操作栏、会话工具栏和输入区提供入口，也支持 /forward 命令；可批量合并消息、编辑转发文本、选择静默发送或填入草稿，并携带图片。适合在不同 DSH 会话间交接阶段性内容、继续后续任务的用户。无需额外 API 密钥；插件使用 DSH 会话服务完成投递。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4594-4619","lib/client.js:2725-2790","lib/index.js:26-28"]}
{"unit_id":"Domaki-co__dsh-message-forward#card-en","repo":"Domaki-co/dsh-message-forward","commit":"27ac583ad4a62be7ad743e02ea99cde6a7f74391","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-forward is a DSH web plugin for forwarding user messages or model replies, with images, between sessions. It adds reply and session controls plus /forward. Users can merge messages, edit the text, and send silently, jump to the target, or fill a draft. No extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4594-4619","lib/client.js:2725-2790","lib/index.js:26-28"]}
